Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:06.78,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1200,5000,5900)\pos(640,335.962)}Episode 70
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:06.78,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1200,5000,5900)\pos(653.755,546.455)}Return of the Sima Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:46.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,5460,5780)\pos(324,473)}Guō Huái\NStyled: Bójì
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, even though Minister Wang is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:50.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2500,2900)\pos(960,500)}Cáo Zhēn\NStyled: Zǐdān
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we can take this chance to annihilate the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is expecting us to be busy with the funeral arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He will surely come to raid our camp tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You should split the army into four routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Two routes can take the \Nmountain paths to attack the Shu camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other two can set up an ambush outside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Shu army arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we can attack from both sides and achieve a total victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan is excellent, exactly what I had in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Zhu Zan and Cao Zun to the tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we must defeat Kongming and restore our might!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:54.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang had cursed Wang Lang to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:59.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Zhen expected the Shu army to attack the Wei camp during Wang Lang's funeral,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and expected a night raid on the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:05.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Heeding General Guo Huai's advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:08.81,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he divided the army into four routes overnight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to surprise attack the Shu camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:24.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Unexpectedly, they themselves fell into the Shu army's ambush,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:25.65,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and a chaotic battle ensued.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.65,0:02:29.40,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The damaged Wei units could not \Ndistinguish each other in the dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:34.53,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and they fought among themselves,\N resulting in a self-destructive defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Chief-Commander Cao Zhen has suffered consecutive defeats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2380,2700)\pos(317,473)}Cáo Ruì\NStyled: Yuánzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As the situation is critical, he seeks aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make a decision, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:21.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2620,3060)\pos(324,472)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest, we can practice later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, we have trained ourselves for the empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Emperor is not using us. Why practice anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,680)}Whenever you kids meet a setback, you give up and slacken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}How will you achieve greatness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Do you know of Minister of the Masses, Wang Lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,680)}He was seventy-six of age, yet \Nhe still marched out as a strategist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}It is as Lord Cao said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:04:02.08,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Lines from {\i1}Though the Tortoise Lives Long{\i0} (龜雖壽), \None of Cao Cao's most famous poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,680)}"By the trough the old steed lies,\Nyet a thousand {\i1}li{\i0} it vies;"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:58.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,573)}-Wang Lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,680)}"Warriors brave in late years,\Nyet his proud heart never dies."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Show respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, that Wang Lang was cursed at by Zhuge Liang in front of armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,then he fell off his horse and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I dare lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}I laughed because that Wang Lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}said to be a wise thinker, was in truth so feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}He could not even handle a few insults.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Truly, he deserved such an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}You would do well to remember this:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}With magnanimity can a man become great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it was you who praised him, and now it is you who curses him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not know which to follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}The art of life is the art of adaptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}How can anyone be partial to one side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Such is also the art of war; \Nall about adapting to the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The art of war, the art of war...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What art is there, when there's no wars for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If not even the Chief-Commander could defeat Zhuge Liang, who can?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that our Great Wei \Nis about to be destroyed by Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when Your Majesty takes command and uses every man will the foe be repelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Chang'an will be lost and \Nthe Guanzhong region will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, defeating Zhuge Liang is not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When a commander has exceptional intellect, he can lead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:28.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(886.667,468)}Zhōng Yáo, \NStyled: Yuáncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing oneself and the enemy ensures victory in every battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In my view, even though\N Cao Zidan is experienced in war,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,he is no match for Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I pledge my family's lives to recommend one person who can repel the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Your Majesty approve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a loyal minister. If there is a talent who can repel the Shu army,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,summon him to share Our burden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, not long ago,\N Zhuge Liang planned to invade,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but he feared this person, so he spread falsehoods
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and made Your Majesty revoke his authority out of suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang marched afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If Your Majesty appoints him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,how can we fear that the \NShu army will not be repelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to Great General of Fast Cavalry Sima Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you always come here to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and always return empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord of Wei has long since forgotten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Sacred edict of the Emperor of the Great Wei:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The Shu army is invading the borders, and the situation is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}We shall personally lead the campaign,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and we hereby restore Sima Yi as the Great General of Fast Cavalry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and assign him as Commander-who-Pacifies-the-West.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Raise all armies of Nanyang in as fast as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}and move to Chang'an to rendezvous with Us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}in order to repel the Shu army. Thus We decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,May he live ten thousand years!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army is constantly retreating, and I am planning to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you come instead of guarding Yong'an with your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:36.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,3260,3580)\pos(933.714,299.429)}Lǐ Fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei Administrator of Xincheng, Meng Da,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,has learned that your army has left Mount Qi, so he sent a letter to my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,instructing him to inform you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:45.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,4900,5260)\pos(958,482)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He is willing to raise troops from \NJincheng, Xincheng, and Shangyong
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to capture Luoyang and unite with your army to take the Central Plains in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da was a minister of Han, but he defected to Cao Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:03.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,4220,4660)\pos(948,473)}Mǎ Sù\NStyled: Yòucháng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he rebelling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da's defection to Wei was out of necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When Cao Pi was in power, he valued Meng Da's talent and treated him well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but after Cao Pi's death, Cao Rui ascended the throne and many in the court envied him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da was anxious day and night, hence his rebellious intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, upon hearing your campaign, he wants to atone for his sins
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and assist in unifying the world under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a letter written by Meng Da himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chancellor, read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If Meng Da could capture Luoyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I could then take Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Capital would be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Cao Wei not fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this is exactly Meng Da's intention,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came to bring good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is indeed great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have traveled hard. Go and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, will Meng Da's rebellion succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army is pressing towards Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Wei is defending their front but neglecting their rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A rebellion would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Recovering the Central Plains and restoring the Han dynasty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just around the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we should toast to Meng Da's rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, with such good news, let us have a small drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, urgent news!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Rui, ruler of Wei, is leading the army to Chang'an
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and has instated Sima Yi as \NCommander who Pacifies the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mobilizing every force from Nanyang to converge at Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Investigate further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Report back immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Cao Rui is not to be feared. If he comes to Chang'an, we can capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why be so surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why fear Cao Rui? The only one to worry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...is Sima Yi, and him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Meng Da wants to rebel,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,yet if he encounters Sima Yi, his plan will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da is no match for Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be captured by Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If Meng Da dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,then the Central Plains cannot be taken yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why not urgently write a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,to warn Meng Da to be cautious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Meng Da keeps his plans secret and is not discovered by Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:21.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,4700,5060)\pos(312,553)}Mèng Dá
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that Zhuge Liang is very cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This letter seems to prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313,485)}Shēn Dān\NStyled: Yìjǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General Meng.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:28.82,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Shen Dan's younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:28.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298.286,490.286)}Shēn Yí
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the letter say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang advises me in the letter to keep everything secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to trust others easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Be cautious and guard against Sima Yi."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Rui has reinstated Sima Yi's position,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,mobilizing forces from Nanyang to resist Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has been reinstated?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Reinstated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is too cautious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wan City is eight hundred {\i1}li{\i0} from Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Sima Yi knows of my rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he will need to report to the \NLord of Wei, using up one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time he raises his troops to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Meng is absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,General Meng is absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.07,0:15:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Report, sir! The Administrator of Jincheng, Shen Yi, has sent his kin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming there is a secret matter to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Administrator of Jincheng, Shen Yi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bring him to the secret room.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Meng Da know you have come?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da does not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is due to the great fortune of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da has colluded with the Administrator of Jincheng, Shen Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Administrator of Shangyong, Shen Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They plan to rebel and capture Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's army is at Mount Qi, scaring everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Son of Heaven had to move to Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not deploy me in time, both capitals will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,General Shen was wise to return to the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Revealing a traitor is a wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will request the Emperor to give out rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what should we do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we quickly write a memorial to the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait for the imperial decree, a month will pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luoyang will surely fall to Meng Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da's rebellion must be in collusion with Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will capture this traitor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang will then be demoralized and retreat without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The army must march to Xincheng, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make it there in half the normal time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone late shall be executed without mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the Emperor has \Nordered us to meet in Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we are marching to Xincheng, against his orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:07.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,4300,4620)\pos(292,494)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: \NZǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Emperor blames you for delaying the battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That will not be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A general must, in a time of national crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,act with resolve to eliminate any threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Failing to do so is dereliction of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have made up my mind. You young ones do not understand, do not speak further.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have Adjutant Liang Ji pass my orders to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rush to Xincheng overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Instruct Meng Da to organize his troops and prepare to join the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You will return to General Shen as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to pretend that nothing is wrong and prepare the rebellion with Meng Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Only delay it by a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.93,0:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for our army to arrive so we may capture the traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:19:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not leak this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You all will follow me to Xincheng immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da did not heed my warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall die by Sima Yi's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why do you say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da's letter says that even if Sima Yi knew about his rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,he would first report to the Wei ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wan City is eight hundred {\i1}li{\i0} from Luoyang
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and the report would take over a month, so he says there is no need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he not know that\N Sima Yi is a master strategist?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He would understand the tactic of surprise and exploiting the unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Rui entrusted Sima Yi with eliminating enemies as they arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If he knows Meng Da is rebelling,\N why would he report to the ruler of Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In less than ten days, his soldiers will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:20:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Meng Da not be captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You must rush back tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell General Meng he must not let anyone know if he has not acted yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If the news leaks, it will be a certain defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it is better for me to write a letter to Meng Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to the Commander, we have captured a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me, spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not kill you. Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am from the Shu camp, returning to Xincheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Zhuge Liang know about Meng Da's rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows. He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He said to be very wary of Sima...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no... Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What should he be wary of?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be wary of the Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...not reporting to the Lord of Wei and leading troops to Xincheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...to catch Meng Da off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Zhuge Liang really say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a letter here. Please read it, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is indeed a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, great minds think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the Emperor is blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Receiving this information ensures Meng Da's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:21:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go, take him away!\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me! Spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to act tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then inform Generals Shen Yi and Shen Dan
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to replace the banners with those of Great Han, and march to Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How laughable and foolish Sima Yi is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.25,0:22:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He still orders me to prepare the troops and await his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Little does he know, when fire breaks out in the front and back,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,he will be unable to handle both ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.95,0:22:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Meng, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.05,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dust is rising outside the city, a large army is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.93,0:22:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose soldiers are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't identified them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang anticipated this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation has come to this, we must fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.59,0:23:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General Shen has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we should go out and attack from both sides to defeat the Wei army!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lower the drawbridge, follow me out of the city!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.77,0:24:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, you arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go capture Sima Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.94,0:24:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor, get off your horse and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.36,0:24:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:35.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,4300,4620)\pos(291.429,481.143)}Lí Fǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor Meng Da, surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.75,0:24:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.55,0:24:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the city gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have surrendered the city. Traitor, surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shameless villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.75,0:24:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You ruined my plan, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor Meng Da, why not surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.33,0:25:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I might spare your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.27,0:26:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.74,0:26:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Generals, for your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Commander, enter the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.77,0:26:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.59,0:27:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Meng Da was not \Ndiscreet in his actions, and thus was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.25,0:27:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, do not grieve too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Shen Yi reported to me of Meng Da's rebellion in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.88,0:27:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to report to Your Majesty, but feared the delay in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.59,0:27:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left overnight without waiting for the imperial decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.70,0:27:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we had waited for the report, we would've fallen into Zhuge Liang's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask for Your Majesty's forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.15,0:27:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved minister, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.62,0:27:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da, that traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.89,0:27:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for your swift action, \Nour Great Wei would be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.75,0:27:55.89,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Sun: Refers to either Sun Tzu or Sun Bin (孫臏).\NWu: Refers to Wu Qi (吴起)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.75,0:27:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your knowledge surpasses that of Sun and Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.89,0:27:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I grant you a pair of golden axes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.52,0:28:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, for any critical matters, you will not need to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.40,0:28:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply act accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.64,0:28:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.83,0:28:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, with the enemy at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.91,0:28:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will put aside past grievances.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat the Shu army and achieve more victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.46,0:28:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I will give my all \Nand serve you for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:41.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Sima Yi eliminated Meng Da,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.26,0:28:45.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he led the army with General Zhang He as the vanguard
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:49.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to resist the Shu army with great momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is always cautious in his use of troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He fears losses and avoids taking risks,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:29:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so he will not advance through\N Ziwu Valley to capture Chang'an directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:04.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286,434)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He will certainly come through Xie Valley to take Mei City.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.16,0:29:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If he takes Mei City, he will split his forces into two:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.53,0:29:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One route to take Ji Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.24,0:29:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ordered Cao Zhen to guard Mei City
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.91,0:29:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to engage in battle when the enemy arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.03,0:29:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ordered Kong Li and Xin Pi to guard the entrance of Ji Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When the enemy arrives, they will ambush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.31,0:29:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you, the Chief-Commander, plan to advance from?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.57,0:29:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\}To the west of the Qinling Mountains, there is a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}It is called Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}There is a city nearby named Lieliu City.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.14,0:29:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}These two are chokepoints towards Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}General, we will seize Jieting directly and approach Yangping Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}If Zhuge Liang learns of Jieting being cut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.43,0:29:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,680)}he would know his grain supplies would be cut off,\N and that he could not defend Longxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.41,0:29:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}He would then run back to Hanzhong overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.02,0:29:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}If he retreats,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.72,0:30:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}I will attack him through small paths with my forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}and total victory can be achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}If he does not retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}I will block all the small paths by guarding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.35,0:30:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}One month of no grain will starve them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.63,0:30:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,663)}Then, Zhuge Liang will surely capitulate!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.73,0:30:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, brilliant strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.50,0:30:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Though this is the plan, \NZhuge Liang is not like Meng Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,General, as the vanguard, do not advance rashly!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.25,0:30:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the road to the west of\N the mountains and scout ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.12,0:30:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only advance when you are certain there are no ambushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Any negligence, and you will fall into Zhuge Liang's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can Zhuge Liang really predict my advance to Jieting?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:31:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is highly skilled in military arts, he is no ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now he is leading his army to confront our forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We all must be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Da lacked discretion, so his death was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.54,0:31:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Sima Yi has come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he will surely take Jieting \Nto cut off our supply route.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.92,0:31:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jieting is small but crucial, it is our one supply line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.43,0:31:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jieting is lost, our army will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.53,0:31:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we must send a strong force to guard it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.62,0:31:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.97,0:31:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will lead the troops to guard Jieting?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.89,0:31:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I, Ma Su, am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:04.77,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(288,482.667)}Zhào Yún\N Styled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:07.81,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304,493.333)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.97,0:32:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle of Jieting will be crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.41,0:32:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our first campaign out of Mount Qi, \Nand our success or failure depends on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.05,0:32:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, withdraw for now and carefully consider how to resist the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must also be extremely cautious to avoid failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.73,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:14.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Elder General Zhao is advanced in age now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.41,0:33:19.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:22.89,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Ma Su...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.62,0:33:43.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I am here to request a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:46.27,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why did you not approve?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.27,0:33:50.65,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Do you think I am unfit for the task and thus ended the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.56,0:33:55.56,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,I, Ma Su, have only ever advised under the tent,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.56,0:33:58.48,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,never fought on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.08,0:34:03.63,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The other officers doubt me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.63,0:34:07.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,claiming that I only know of military tactics on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:13.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On this time, the first campaign out of Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.18,0:34:15.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I must show my fullest at Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:21.63,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, why worry about the respect of the generals?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.85,0:34:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.96,0:34:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Youchang?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.70,0:34:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to guard Jieting. Please approve, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.38,0:35:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jieting has neither city walls nor natural defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Defending it is extremely difficult. Are you aware?\N-I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.50,0:35:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is an expert in military strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and his vanguard, Zhang He, is a renowned general in Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.14,0:35:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that you are no match for these two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.82,0:35:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be it Sima Yi and Zhang He,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,or if Cao Rui comes himself, what is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jieting is lost, our army will be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This responsibility is far too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.48,0:35:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have studied military books since childhood and know of strategic arts well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.29,0:35:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jieting is a strategic location, I understand its importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.84,0:35:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lead the troops there,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.09,0:35:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will guard it meticulously without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.69,0:35:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feel assured, Chancellor, and wait for good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.10,0:36:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are skilled in strategy, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.96,0:36:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, Sima Yi-
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! If Jieting is lost, you may execute my entire family!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.95,0:36:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no jests in military matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.20,0:36:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to sign a military pledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.63,0:36:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, since I started following you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.79,0:36:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have offered many plans,\N but achieved few military merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.53,0:36:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,At this critical juncture,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.36,0:36:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wish to contribute all my knowledge to the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.16,0:36:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, to repay the Court's grace and my parents' wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.82,0:36:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I earnestly request the Chancellor to let me defeat the enemy and honor our nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.56,0:36:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,shed blood on the battlefield, and die without regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.50,0:36:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.36,0:37:28.20,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,To the Chancellor of Han: The defense of Jieting is top priority. I, Shu general Ma Su, am willing to lead troops to defend it. Should Jieting fall, let my entire family be executed. I make this pledge as proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.92,0:37:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you twenty-five thousand elite troops and a top general to assist you. Do not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.32,0:37:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will follow the Chancellor's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.06,0:37:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wang Ping.\N-Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.09,0:38:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are cautious in your endeavors,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.24,0:38:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so I entrust you with this important task.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.13,0:38:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Ma Su will guard Jieting together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful in your defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.68,0:38:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up camp at strategic points to prevent the enemy from sneaking through.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.58,0:38:14.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333,500)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.87,0:38:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,After setting up camp, quickly draw a map and send it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.52,0:38:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Discuss everything and act accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.93,0:38:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The importance of Jieting is great. If it is secured,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you two will be the first to capture Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.22,0:38:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I sincerely hope you will both\N achieve merits for the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.49,0:38:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Chancellor, we will guard Jieting,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.37,0:38:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and let not a single Wei soldier pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.52,0:38:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gao Xiang.\N-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.85,0:39:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Northeast of Jieting is a city called Lieliu City.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.37,0:39:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will give you ten thousand troops. \NIf Jieting is in danger, lead a rescue force.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.66,0:39:25.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,345)}Gāo Xiáng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.82,0:39:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.09,0:39:28.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Gao Xiang is no match for Zhang He.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.55,0:39:33.32,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,I must send another good officer to garrison Jieting in order to defend against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.32,0:39:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wei Yan.\N-Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lead your troops to the rear of Jieting to garrison in case of unexpected events.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.09,0:39:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Why place me in such an idle position?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking the enemy in the \Nfrontlines is but a minor task.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.64,0:39:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to support Jieting and guard the chokepoint to Hanzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.91,0:39:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This can only be undertaken by a great general.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.51,0:39:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How can it be an idle position?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.55,0:40:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not take it lightly, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.20,0:40:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After Jieting is secured, our army will be able to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.00,0:40:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun, Deng Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Sima Yi is leading troops, the situation is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.73,0:40:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are to lead troops out of Ji Valley as decoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you encounter Wei troops, either fight or retreat to disturb them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.27,0:40:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead the main force in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.54,0:40:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei will be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.38,0:40:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We advance through Xie Valley to capture Mei City. \NThen, Chang'an can be captured.
Comment: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:07.10,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,The original name card mistakenly said Sima Shi when the character is really Sima Zhao.

